==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 24~30.67 seconds<sup>720f~920f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 24~30.67 seconds<sup>720f~920f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 24~30.67 seconds<sup>720f~920f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a fairly simple stage with Kurosawah being the boss joined with Squire Rels and Doge Darks. Therefore, all you need is to spam a couple of cheap meatshields and generalist attackers or [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark cats]], like [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Plane Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]]. Fast attackers such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can also help. It is important to bring either spammable units or units that outrange Director Kurosawah, as there is no point in trying to tank such a damaging enemy unless using a [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|tanker]].

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
Generally, any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] that has a [[Special Abilities|special ability]] against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies will do well here. Any [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] Ubers that you may have will also help to speed things up. Below are more specified examples of good Ubers to use in this stage.
*[[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|Urashima Taro]]: Use him in any form other than his Normal Form, and he will be able to tank the attacks of Director Kurosawah and the Doge Darks seamlessly.
*[[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]]: Similar usage to Awakened Bahamut Cat in this case.
*[[Uesugi Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Uesugi Kenshin]]: Her high DPS and [[Strong Against|strong]] against Dark enemies helps take out Director Kurosawah and the Doge Darks quickly.
*[[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Maeda Keiji]]: Same as Urashima Taro, except you can use any form and he'll do well.
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]]: His [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] to any Dark foe makes this stage quick and painless.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: No-brainer. Makes the stage incredibly easy.
*[[Chun-Li (Uber Rare Cat)|Chun-Li]]: A semi-rusher type unit. Her high DPS and low cost makes the stage quick and painless, somewhat similar in usage to Sanada Yukimura except tankier.
*[[Bunny & Canard (Uber Rare Cat)|Bunny & Canard]]: His sheer attack power against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies is no joke, and he will be able to make this stage go by faster. Make sure to use the Normal Form only.

